h of the ASCERTAIN project in Rotterdam! \", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s84\", \"doc_id\": \"web-f9552075330dd435c5a02363\", \"start\": 8419, \"end\": 8816, \"text\": \"Our consortium members gathered to kick off this HORIZON-funded initiative project.\\nContact\\nPlease get in touch with us if you have any questions or comments! We will get back to you as soon as possible.\\nFor research-related questions:\\nCarin Uyl-de Groot\\nProject Coordinator\\nErasmus University Rotterdam\\nln.rue.mphse@lyu\\nPhone: +31 10 4081583\\nFor general project questions:\\nMarcel Langone Marques\\n\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s85\", \"doc_id\": \"web-f9552075330dd435c5a02363\", \"start\": 8816, \"end\": 9210, \"text\": \"Project Manager\\nErasmus University Rotterdam\\nln.rue@seuqramenognal.lecram\\nPhone: +31 10 4081583\\nFor communications:\\nLena Jessen\\nProject Manager\\nOptiMedis\\ned.sidemitpo@nessej.l\\nPhone: +49 40 226211490\\nOur Partners\\nSUPPORT\\nLegal Notice\\nPrivacy Policy\\nCookie Policy\\nSITEMAP\\nASCERTAIN Project\\nAbout\\nImpact\\nWork Packages\\nConsortium\\nAdvisory Board\\nFinal Conference\\nNews & Events\\nFor Patients\\nResults\\n\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s86\", \"doc_id\": \"web-f9552075330dd435c5a02363\", \"start\": 9210, \"end\": 9572, \"text\": \"Contact\\nEnglish\\nDeutsch (German)\\nNorsk bokmål (Norwegian Bokmål)\\nRomână (Romanian)\\nHrvatski (Croatian)\\nFrançais (French)\\nNederlands (Dutch)\\nEspañol (Spanish)\\nStay up to date!\\nTwice a year we will be sending out regular newsletters on the status of our project.\\nEmail\\nLast name\\nFirst name\\nI have read the privacy policy and I want to receive the Newsletter.\\nSend\\n\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s87\", \"doc_id\": \"web-f9552075330dd435c5a02363\", \"start\": 9572, \"end\": 9901, \"text\": \"We use an external service provider to send our newsletter. You can find more information in our privacy policy.\\nThank you for your subscription!\\nWe have sent you an email - please confirm your email address by clicking the activation link in it.\\nWe‘ll send only nice news, don‘t worry.\\nFollow\\nFollow\\nFollow\\n© 2026: OptiMedis AG\\n\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s88\", \"doc_id\": \"web-f9552075330dd435c5a02363\", \"start\": 9901, \"end\": 10227, \"text\": \"Views and opinions expressed are however those of the author(s) only and do not necessarily reflect those of the European Union or the European Health and Digital Executive Agency (HADEA). Neither the European Union nor the granting authority can be held responsible for them. Grant Agreement 101094938.\\nManage Cookie Consent\\n\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s89\", \"doc_id\": \"web-f9552075330dd435c5a02363\", \"start\": 10227, \"end\": 10581, \"text\": \"To provide the best experiences, we use technologies like cookies to store and/or access device information. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as browsing behavior or unique IDs on this site. Not consenting or withdrawing consent, may adversely affect certain features and functions.\\nFunctional\\nFunctional\\nAlways active\\n\", \"source_role\": \"document\", \"source_message_indices\": [], \"time_metadata\": {}}, {\"id\": \"s90\", \"doc_id\": \"web-f9552075330dd435c5a02363\", \"start\": 10581, \"end\": 10895, \"text\": \"The technical storage or access is strictly necessary for the legitimate purpose of enabling the use of a specific service explicitly requested by the subscriber or user, or for the sole purpose of carrying out the transmission of a communication over an electronic